In agency operations, burnout shows up as a resourcing problem. Someone is out sick in the middle of a pitch, nobody's workload has a backup, and the account team is left squeezed between what the client wants this week and what the studio can deliver.

Spill gives everyone confidential counseling in one click from Slack or a phone, often the same day, with evening and weekend sessions, so getting support doesn't take anyone off a deadline. [The agency page on Spill's site]({{industry_url}}) has the detail.

