People teams in digital health often look after two very different groups: engineers and product people working at startup speed, and clinicians carrying anxious patients and a zero-error standard. A benefit has to fit both.

Spill gives everyone confidential counseling from their own phone, Slack or Teams, often the same day, with sessions around clinical shifts. It's HIPAA compliant, and you see only anonymized usage. [Our page for digital health companies]({{industry_url}}) goes into more detail.

Best wishes,
