For a charter school or network leader, the retention math is stark. Losing one strong teacher means recruiting, onboarding and covering their classes, sometimes mid-year, and salary is only one way to compete for good teachers.

Spill gives every adult in the building private counseling from a personal phone, often the same day, around the school day. It gives you something real to offer beyond salary, and it takes hours to set up. [Spill's page for charter schools]({{industry_url}}) sets out what staff get.

Best wishes,
{{sender_first_name}}

