Fashion retail asks a lot of a young, mostly part-time team: commission pressure, a culture where appearance matters, difficult customers and seasonal peaks. Support only helps if an associate can reach it from the stockroom on a break.

Spill gives every associate private counseling they can arrange by text from their own phone, often the same day, with sessions before and after shifts. Store leads get training to support their teams. [Here's how it works in fashion retail]({{industry_url}}).

Best wishes,
{{sender_first_name}}

