Fashion retail staffs up and down with the seasons, and the young, part-time team that carries the peaks also turns over fastest. When someone doesn't show for a Saturday shift, the store lead covers it or the floor runs short.

Spill gives every associate, part-time and seasonal included, private counseling by text from their own phone, often the same day, with sessions before and after shifts. Seasonal headcount changes are simple to handle month to month. The detail is on [Spill's fashion and apparel page]({{industry_url}}).

