The fitness industry sells health and often runs its own people hard: 5am opens, split shifts, pay tied to commissions and class counts, and a smile expected all day. Members notice how a brand treats its staff, and so do the trainers you'll want to hire.

Spill gives your whole team private counseling from their own phone, often the same day, so you back their mental health as visibly as you back members' physical health. It takes hours to set up. [Spill's page for fitness and recreation businesses]({{industry_url}}) shows what your team would get.

